      "type": "sentence",
      "source": "Note: If the reference’s underlying socket is used in a run loop or select() call, it should be removed BEFORE [`DNSServiceRefDeallocate(_:)`](dnsservicerefdeallocate(_:).md) is called, as this function closes the reference’s socket.",
      "normalizedSource": "Note: If the reference’s underlying socket is used in a run loop or select() call, it should be removed BEFORE [`DNSServiceRefDeallocate(_:)`](dnsservicerefdeallocate(_:).md) is called, as this function closes the reference’s socket.",
      "sourceHash": "b5dbfd5d21d639b7d9c3d86cfa82f9cea4ef086fa84480e3bea2370de5418d08",
      "translatable": true,
      "contextBefore": "Any Browse, Resolve, or Query operations called with this reference will be terminated.",
      "contextAfter": "Note: If the reference was initialized with [`DNSServiceCreateConnection(_:)`](dnsservicecreateconnection(_:).md), any DNSRecordRefs created via this reference will be invalidated by this call - the resource records are deregistered, and their DNSRecordRefs may not be used in subsequent functions.",
      "documentTitle": "DNSServiceRefDeallocate(:)",
