      "blockId": "paragraph:discussion:0010",
      "type": "sentence",
      "source": "Note: If the reference was initialized with [`DNSServiceCreateConnection(_:)`](dnsservicecreateconnection(_:).md), any DNSRecordRefs created via this reference will be invalidated by this call - the resource records are deregistered, and their DNSRecordRefs may not be used in subsequent functions.",
      "normalizedSource": "Note: If the reference was initialized with [`DNSServiceCreateConnection(_:)`](dnsservicecreateconnection(_:).md), any DNSRecordRefs created via this reference will be invalidated by this call - the resource records are deregistered, and their DNSRecordRefs may not be used in subsequent functions.",
