      "translatable": true,
      "contextBefore": "Note: If the reference’s underlying socket is used in a run loop or select() call, it should be removed BEFORE [`DNSServiceRefDeallocate(_:)`](dnsservicerefdeallocate(_:).md) is called, as this function closes the reference’s socket.",
      "contextAfter": "Similarly, if the reference was initialized with [`DNSServiceRegister(_:_:_:_:_:_:_:_:_:_:_:_:)`](dnsserviceregister(_:_:_:_:_:_:_:_:_:_:_:_:).md), and an extra resource record was added to the service via [`DNSServiceAddRecord(_:_:_:_:_:_:_:)`](dnsserviceaddrecord(_:_:_:_:_:_:_:).md), the DNSRecordRef created by the add call is invalidated when this function is called - the DNSRecordRef may not be used in subsequent functions.",
